Creating libraries
Created data sets are temporarily saved in the WORK library. However, if we need to permanently save our created data sets, then we need to save it in a folder through a created library. Therefore, we need to create a folder in the ‘Server Files and the Folders’ -&gt; ‘Created_folder’ -&gt; Properties option -&gt; copy the location. Then run the similar code:
libname my_lib '/home/u62633132/Class_data' ;
run;
